        2506,
        1766
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, such orders issued prior to January 5, 2026 did not provide or require a plan for actions that would enable DOC to come into compliance with applicable laws and regulations for which compliance is not required as a result of such orders; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
